{"series":{"id":"shen-long-xing-zhu","slug":"shen-long-xing-zhu","title":"Shen Long Xing Zhu","image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-03/im_1.jpg?itok=RSci88_K","synopsis":"Gufeng, la antigua entidad guardiana del divino dragón estelar, despierta después de siglos y descubre que la estrella del dragón ha cambiado. Para investigar la verdad y recuperar un tesoro en la Academia del Rey Dragón, adopta forma humana y se convierte en profesor. Sin embargo, termina enseñando caza de dragones. Mientras busca el tesoro, se involucra con la vicepresidenta de la academia, Ye Jiangxue, y enfrenta amenazas de su pasado. Gufeng forma una nueva legión de dragones divinos con estudiantes para enfrentar a los enemigos que se acercan. En este viaje lleno de desafíos, deberá revelar misterios y asegurar el destino de la estrella del dragón.","status":"En Emisión","year":2024,"genres":[],"type":"donghua","src":"donghualife","sourceUrls":["https://donghualife.com/series/shen-long-xing-zhu"],"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:20:12.594Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"shen-long-xing-zhu-t1","slug":"shen-long-xing-zhu-t1","seriesId":"shen-long-xing-zhu","number":1,"image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-03/im_1.jpg?itok=RSci88_K","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:20:12.594Z","episodeCount":48}],"episodes":[{"id":"shen-long-xing-zhu-t1-e47","slug":"shen-long-xing-zhu-t1-e47","title":"shen-long-xing-zhu-1-episodio-x47","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/shen-long-xing-zhu-1-episodio-x47","servers":[{"name":"ok.ru","url":"https://ok.ru/videoembed/7585627638485","embed":true},{"name":"dailymotion.com","url":"https://www.dailymotion.com/embed/video/k76XaZluLsk99iAThcC","embed":true}],"seriesId":"shen-long-xing-zhu","seasonId":"shen-long-xing-zhu-t1","number":47,"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:39:10.353Z"},{"id":"shen-long-xing-zhu-t1-e48","slug":"shen-long-xing-zhu-t1-e48","title":"shen-long-xing-zhu-1-episodio-x48","sourceUrl"